$DIR/test.p:36:15: cannot index B: method SetIndex must have the form SetIndex(k K, v V)
    The indexing methods have fixed forms, so that x[k] can be turned into a
    call: Index(k K) V, SetIndex(k K, v V) and IndexOk(k K) (V, bool). They may
    not have type parameters of their own or be variadic.
    (see "Indexing library containers" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.11)
    (run "pluto explain E2452" for a longer explanation)
